refresh_failing.description:
Home Assistant hasn't been able to get new TURN credentials from Cloudflare since {since}. The current ones work until {expires}. After that, camera streams that need the relay, for example away from home or behind a VPN, won't connect.

Last error: {error}

Check Home Assistant's internet connection and [Cloudflare's status page]({status_url}). Home Assistant keeps retrying, and this notice goes away by itself once it succeeds.

refresh_failing_expired.description:
Home Assistant hasn't been able to get new TURN credentials from Cloudflare since {since}, and the last ones expire at {expires}, too soon to hand out. Camera streams that need the relay, for example away from home or behind a VPN, won't connect until a refresh succeeds.

Last error: {error}

Check Home Assistant's internet connection and [Cloudflare's status page]({status_url}). Home Assistant keeps retrying, and this notice goes away by itself once it succeeds.
